  "pitch": "Microsoft's 2015 EdgeHTML browser, replaced by Chromium-based Edge.",
  "summary": "Windows 10's original Edge (codename Spartan) built on EdgeHTML and Chakra, with reading view, web notes and WebExtension-style add-ons. Replaced by Chromium Edge from January 2020 and removed in April 2021.",
